  "description": "Conversion, extension and partial demolition of the Manor House (including demolition of modern rear extensions and internal alterations) to provide 7no. residential units and communal amenity space;  Demolition of the existing pool extension and erection of a 3-storey annex building providing 5no. residential units;  Redevelopment of existing Gate House 1 to create 1no. residential unit;  Erection of two storey Gate House 2 to create 1no. residential unit;  Erection of four x 5-storey residential buildings: Building 1 containing 9no. residential units; Building 2 containing 9no. residential units; Building 3 containing 13no. residential units; Building 4 containing 9no. residential units;  (Total 54no. self-contained units);  Associated landscaping to create communal areas, amenity space, refuse/recycling storage, cycle storage and 6no. car parking spaces at ground level;  Provision of 61no. car parking spaces within Basement 1, accessed via external car ramp, alongside ancillary cycle parking, motorcycle parking, refuse store, plant and storage rooms;  Basement 2 to include plant room and amenity space;  Replacement of existing substation and associated plant equipment.",
